 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased — MP4 evaluation
+
+- Replaced real-time WebM recording with Browser Media I/O H.264/AAC MP4 rendering at 30 fps.
+- Video duration comes from decoded PCM samples, including inputs with incorrect MP3 duration headers.
+- Preserved landscape/portrait layouts, image fitting, subtitle positioning, wrapping, outline and band controls.
+- Added explicit progress, cancellation and input locking while exporting. Changes invalidate stale downloads.
+- Bundled dependencies for static hosting and offline operation after page load.
+- Added six Playwright integration tests plus independent FFmpeg/ffprobe checks.
+- See MP4_EVALUATION.md for measured results and remaining preview/file-URL limitations.
+
 ## v1.64.2
 
 - Fixed false adjacent-row overlap highlighting in the right pane.
