 ## Important video export note
 
-During WebM creation, keep the browser tab in the foreground. If you switch tabs while recording, the browser may throttle canvas rendering. The output WebM may still be created with audio, but subtitles may be missing.
+MP4 export decodes the soundtrack and renders each frame at 30 fps. Its length comes from decoded audio samples. Export does not play or record the soundtrack and does not depend on the preview animation loop. Browser suspension can still pause processing; keep the page open until it finishes.
+
